# - v1707/v1708 had /gbigfiles and /gclean_disk routed before their function bodies existed.
# - The active guard calls main() before code appended after main(), so those functions never loaded.
# - This block is intentionally before main(). No trade/ledger/strategy mutation. Auto-buy OFF.
