# Guard v2.6.49 / v2221: safe one-minute upgrade orchestration.
# v2220 incorrectly applied the shared remaining-time budget directly to
# systemctl stop/start. When only one second remained, Review was stopped and
# the corresponding start was cut off with rc=124. v2221 preserves all core
# checks but removes deadline-clipping from critical service-control commands.
# A restart transaction, once begun, is completed atomically and then verified.
