# Guard v2.6.70 / v2252
# Recovery-safe environment-owner precheck and silent-continuation suppression.
# Root causes fixed:
# - v2248 runtime token-owner proof ran before the selected bundle could restart
#   Review, so an already-stopped Review blocked the exact recovery intended by
#   v2251.
# - the old polling process could observe that the continuation request had
#   already been consumed after Guard restart, queue the internal silent sentinel
#   as a final reply, and expose it in Telegram.
# Contract:
# - env files/drop-ins are still fail-closed before apply
# - Main/Guard/Paper must remain active with exactly one dedicated token
# - Review may be inactive only while the current sealed bundle explicitly owns
#   Review and requires its restart; strict all-service proof runs after apply
# - selected manifest remains the only Review target owner
# - one receipt, one selected/start notice, one final result
# - no strategy/prediction/candidate/entry/exit/ledger changes; auto-buy OFF
# =============================================================================
